  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP - San Marcos institutionella f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning f&#xf6;r landsbygdsutveckling</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP- San Marcos Institutional Strengthening for Rural Development Joint Program - Guatemala - UN San Marcos Institutional Strengthening JP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till att st&#xe4;rka och st&#xf6;dja sektoriella institutioner och kommuner, som styrande institutioner, f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; en effektiv, demokratisk och deltagande styrning som m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;r inkluderande &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder f&#xf6;r att minska den multidimensionella fattigdomen, &#xf6;ka j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldheten, &#xf6;ka kapaciteten f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rvaltning av naturresurser, st&#xe4;rka anpassningen till klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar, st&#xe4;rka katastrofriskminskning samt att &#xf6;ka bevarandet av den biologiska m&#xe5;ngfalden f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka motst&#xe5;ndskraften hos befolkningen i Altiplano Marquense och fr&#xe4;mja landsbygdsutveckling i omr&#xe5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The joint program aims to strengthen and support sectoral institutions and municipalities, as government institutions, to achieve an effective, democratic, and participatory governance that allows inclusive actions to reduce multidimensional poverty, gender inequality, increase capacities for management of natural resources, climate change adaptation, disaster risk reduction and biodiversity conservation to increase the resilience of Altiplano Marquense population and promote rural development in the area.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The joint program aims to strengthen and support sectoral institutions and municipalities, as government institutions, to achieve an effective, democratic, and participatory governance that allows inclusive actions through a multidimensional approach to reduce poverty, gender inequality, increase capacities natural resources management, climate change adaptation, disaster risk reduction (Sendai Framework) and biodiversity conservation to increase the resilience of Altiplano Marquense population and promote rural development in the area.</narrative>
  </description>
